-    "Replace fallback reconstruction with durable per-experiment and per-phase monotonic timing.",
-    "Correlate GPU samples with task identity, compute phase, model concurrency, and runner selection.",
-    "Schedule gate-ready independent compute work concurrently and route only genuine parallel multi-model work through DualGPURunner."
+    "Add task-scoped phase timing so the next retrospective can target measured execution or gate-handoff cost.",
+    "Correlate GPU samples, loaded-model count, and runner selection with each compute task.",
+    "Add event-driven dispatch for independent gate-ready work."
   ],
   "estimated_time_savings_pct": 0,
-  "meta_reflection": "The record ranks the operational tail but does not support causal attribution for the longest task, a compute-time GPU efficiency grade, or a parallel-model runner finding. The next retrospective should distinguish measured execution defects from missing observability at task and phase boundaries."
+  "meta_reflection": "The milestone was brief, but disk-mtime reconstruction and a point-in-time GPU snapshot do not support causal efficiency claims. The next retrospective needs task-linked phase and accelerator telemetry before it can assign a nonzero speedup estimate."
